  </metadata>
  <wpt lat="30.497400" lon="79.613300"><ele>2089</ele><name>Dhak Village Roadhead Trailhead</name><desc>Roadhead near Joshimath on the Malari highway where the Lord Curzon Trail begins.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="30.483000" lon="79.594200"><ele>2711</ele><name>Tugasi &amp; Gulling Terraced Meadows</name><desc>Picturesque Himalayan villages overlooking the Dhauli Ganga canyon.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="30.467700" lon="79.584300"><ele>3250</ele><name>Khullara Alpine Campsite</name><desc>Wide alpine meadow campsite beneath the ridge with direct views of Mount Dronagiri.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="30.452300" lon="79.581100"><ele>3682</ele><name>Kuari Pass Col (Curzon Summit Crest)</name><desc>Historic high pass col framing unobstructed panoramic views of Mount Nanda Devi (7,816m), Kamet, and Trishul.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="30.470900" lon="79.576500"><ele>3282</ele><name>Tali Forest &amp; Sacred Tarn</name><desc>Dense rhododendron and birch forest surrounding the small high-altitude Tali lake.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="30.491900" lon="79.582300"><ele>3531</ele><name>Gorson Bugyal Panoramic Meadows</name><desc>Vast undulating velvet alpine bugyal with front-row amphitheater views of Nanda Devi and Chaukhamba.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="30.535500" lon="79.565300"><ele>2728</ele><name>Auli Ski Slopes &amp; Trailhead</name><desc>Famous Himalayan alpine meadow and ski resort finishing point connecting to Joshimath.</desc></wpt>
